  <entry>
    <title>135按评分分糖果</title>
    <url>/2023/02/01/135%E6%8C%89%E8%AF%84%E5%88%86%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%E7%B3%96%E6%9E%9C/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<h4 id="问题描述"><a href="#问题描述" class="headerlink" title="问题描述"></a>问题描述</h4><p>一群孩子站成一排，每个孩子有自己的评分。现在需要给这些孩子发糖果，规则是如果一个孩子的评分比自己身旁的一个孩子要高，那么这个孩子就必须得到比身旁孩子更多的糖果；所有孩子至少要有一个糖果。求解最少需要多少个糖果<br>输入：孩子评分[1,2,1,2,1,2,1,3,4]<br>输出：所需最少糖果数</p>
<h4 id="我的题解"><a href="#我的题解" class="headerlink" title="我的题解"></a>我的题解</h4><ul>
<li>先排序</li>
<li>数字类别有几类</li>
<li>最小的分一颗糖，按类别依次递增</li>
<li>把糖果加起来</li>
</ul>
<p>题目理解错误：顺序固定，不能排序，只要求，比隔壁评分高，糖果数就比他多1，不是评分相同就拿一样糖果<br>纠正后的题解：</p>
<ul>
<li>定边界，数组小于2时(1,0)，返回len</li>
<li>初始化每个人只有一颗糖果</li>
<li>从左到右遍历，左大于右，左 + 1</li>
<li>从右到左遍历，右大于左，右 + 1</li>
<li>计算总和</li>
</ul>
<p>我根据解法写的代码</p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">countCandiesByRank</span>(<span class="params">rank:<span class="built_in">list</span>[<span class="built_in">int</span>]</span>)-&gt;<span class="built_in">int</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    size = <span class="built_in">len</span>(rank)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> size&lt; <span class="number">2</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> size</span><br><span class="line">    candy_init = [<span class="number">1</span> <span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(size)]</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(size):</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> rank[i] &gt; rank[i + <span class="number">1</span>]:</span><br><span class="line">            candy_init[i] += <span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> rank[i] &gt; rank[i - <span class="number">1</span>]:</span><br><span class="line">            candy_init[i] += <span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="built_in">sum</span>(candy_init)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">countCandiesByRank([<span class="number">20</span>,<span class="number">1</span>,<span class="number">30</span>,<span class="number">40</span>])</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>❌ 错误输出</strong>：</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">IndexError: list index out of range</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></blockquote>
<p>自查发现 存在以下问题<br>1.索引越界<br>2.糖果数不应该是candy[i] +&#x3D; 1</p>
<h4 id="1-索引越界问题"><a href="#1-索引越界问题" class="headerlink" title="1.索引越界问题"></a>1.索引越界问题</h4><p>解决办法：分两次遍历<br>第一次，从左往右遍历，（1，size）<br>比较candy[i] &gt; candy[i - 1]，提前从1开始，i &#x3D; 1时，i - 1为0，不会越界了</p>
<p>同理，<br>第二次，从右往左遍历，（size - 2, -1, -1）<br>因为最右边的数下标为size - 1,必须从倒数第二个开始，不然i + 1就超索引了</p>
<h4 id="2-糖果加法"><a href="#2-糖果加法" class="headerlink" title="2.糖果加法"></a>2.糖果加法</h4><p>解决办法：<br>左大于右，左糖果数 &#x3D; 右糖果数 + 1<br>右大于左，右糖果数 &#x3D; 左糖果数 + 1</p>
<p>代码为</p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">countCandiesByRank</span>(<span class="params">rank:<span class="built_in">list</span>[<span class="built_in">int</span>]</span>)-&gt;<span class="built_in">int</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    size = <span class="built_in">len</span>(rank)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> size&lt; <span class="number">2</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> size</span><br><span class="line">    candy_count = [<span class="number">1</span> <span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(size)]</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="number">1</span>,size):</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> rank[i] &gt; rank[i - <span class="number">1</span>]:</span><br><span class="line">            candy_count[i] = candy_count[i - <span class="number">1</span>] + <span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> j <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(size - <span class="number">2</span>, -<span class="number">1</span>, -<span class="number">1</span>):</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> rank[i] &gt; rank[i + <span class="number">1</span>]:</span><br><span class="line">            candy_count[i] = candy_count[i + <span class="number">1</span>] + <span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="built_in">sum</span>(candy_count)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>❌ 错误输出</strong>：</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">IndexError: list index out of range</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></blockquote>
<p>太粗心，第二次循环变量没改过来</p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">countCandiesByRank</span>(<span class="params">rank:<span class="built_in">list</span>[<span class="built_in">int</span>]</span>)-&gt;<span class="built_in">int</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    size = <span class="built_in">len</span>(rank)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> size&lt; <span class="number">2</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> size</span><br><span class="line">    candy_count = [<span class="number">1</span> <span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(size)]</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="number">1</span>,size):</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> rank[i] &gt; rank[i - <span class="number">1</span>]:</span><br><span class="line">            candy_count[i] = candy_count[i - <span class="number">1</span>] + <span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> j <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(size - <span class="number">2</span>, -<span class="number">1</span>, -<span class="number">1</span>):</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> rank[j] &gt; rank[j + <span class="number">1</span>]:</span><br><span class="line">            candy_count[j] = candy_count[j + <span class="number">1</span>] + <span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="built_in">sum</span>(candy_count)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<p>测试<br>countCandiesByRank([20,1,30,40])<br>结果为8，正确为8<br>countCandiesByRank([2,1,3,4,1,1,2,1])<br>结果为12，正确为13</p>
<p>countCandiesByRank([2,1,3,4,1,1,2,1])<br>手动跑了一遍代码发现，当从左到右遍历完成时<br>candy为[1,1,2,3,1,1,2,1]<br>从右往左遍历时，rank[3] &#x3D;&#x3D; 4 &gt; rank[3+1] &#x3D;&#x3D;1，这一处，原candy[3] &#x3D;&#x3D; 3已经大于candy[4] &#x3D;&#x3D; 1，再令candy[3] &#x3D; candy[4] +1 &#x3D; 1 + 1 &#x3D; 2，会破坏第一层遍历的结果</p>
<p>故将</p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 右→左：只比右边</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> j <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(size - <span class="number">2</span>, -<span class="number">1</span>, -<span class="number">1</span>):</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> rank[j] &gt; rank[j + <span class="number">1</span>]:</span><br><span class="line">            candy_count[j] = candy_count[j + <span class="number">1</span>] + <span class="number">1</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p>改为</p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 右→左：只比右边</span></span><br><span class="line">   <span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(size - <span class="number">2</span>, -<span class="number">1</span>, -<span class="number">1</span>):</span><br><span class="line">       <span class="keyword">if</span> rank[i] &gt; rank[i + <span class="number">1</span>]:</span><br><span class="line">           candy[i] = <span class="built_in">max</span>(candy[i], candy[i + <span class="number">1</span>] + <span class="number">1</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h4 id="正确题解"><a href="#正确题解" class="headerlink" title="正确题解"></a>正确题解</h4><ul>
<li>定边界，数组小于2时(1,0)，返回len</li>
<li>初始化每个人只有一颗糖果</li>
<li>从左到右遍历，左大于右，左 &#x3D; 右 + 1</li>
<li>从右到左遍历，右大于左，右 &#x3D; max(左，右)</li>
<li>计算总和</li>
</ul>
<p>最终代码为</p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">countCandiesByRank</span>(<span class="params">rank: <span class="built_in">list</span>[<span class="built_in">int</span>]</span>) -&gt; <span class="built_in">int</span>:</span><br><span class="line">   size = <span class="built_in">len</span>(rank)</span><br><span class="line">   <span class="keyword">if</span> size &lt; <span class="number">2</span>:</span><br><span class="line">       <span class="keyword">return</span> size</span><br><span class="line">   </span><br><span class="line">   candy = [<span class="number">1</span>] * size</span><br><span class="line">   </span><br><span class="line">   <span class="comment"># 左→右：只比左边</span></span><br><span class="line">   <span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="number">1</span>, size):</span><br><span class="line">       <span class="keyword">if</span> rank[i] &gt; rank[i - <span class="number">1</span>]:</span><br><span class="line">           candy[i] = candy[i - <span class="number">1</span>] + <span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line">   </span><br><span class="line">   <span class="comment"># 右→左：只比右边</span></span><br><span class="line">   <span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(size - <span class="number">2</span>, -<span class="number">1</span>, -<span class="number">1</span>):</span><br><span class="line">       <span class="keyword">if</span> rank[i] &gt; rank[i + <span class="number">1</span>]:</span><br><span class="line">           candy[i] = <span class="built_in">max</span>(candy[i], candy[i + <span class="number">1</span>] + <span class="number">1</span>)</span><br><span class="line">   </span><br><span class="line">   <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="built_in">sum</span>(candy)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>



]]></content>
