  <entry>
    <title>435无重叠区间</title>
    <url>/2023/02/01/435%E6%97%A0%E9%87%8D%E5%8F%A0%E5%8C%BA%E9%97%B4(%E4%BF%AE)/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<ol start="435">
<li>无重叠区间</li>
</ol>
<ul>
<li><strong>难度</strong>：中等</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="题目描述"><a href="#题目描述" class="headerlink" title="题目描述"></a>题目描述</h2><p>给定一个区间的集合 <code>intervals</code> ，其中 <code>intervals[i] = [starti, endi]</code> 。返回 <strong>需要移除区间的最小数量</strong>，使剩余区间互不重叠。</p>
<h3 id="示例-1"><a href="#示例-1" class="headerlink" title="示例 1"></a>示例 1</h3><blockquote>
<p><strong>输入</strong>：intervals &#x3D; [[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[1,3]]<br><strong>输出</strong>：1<br><strong>解释</strong>：移除 [1,3] 后，剩下的区间没有重叠。</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 id="题解思路"><a href="#题解思路" class="headerlink" title="题解思路"></a>题解思路</h2><ol>
<li>先把区间按照结尾大小进行增序排序</li>
<li>选择结尾最小且和前一个区间不重叠的区间</li>
<li>保留最多的区间</li>
</ol>
<h3 id="思考问题"><a href="#思考问题" class="headerlink" title="思考问题"></a>思考问题</h3><ul>
<li>边界是啥？</li>
<li>区间特性：左边不能大于右边</li>
<li>输入啥会超出功能范围</li>
<li>特殊情况是啥？</li>
<li>输入空的列表，或者只有一个区间的列表</li>
<li>怎么让列表按结尾排序？</li>
<li>什么情况是区间重叠</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="按思路写的代码"><a href="#按思路写的代码" class="headerlink" title="按思路写的代码"></a>按思路写的代码</h2><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">eraseOverlapIntervals</span>(<span class="params">intervals: <span class="built_in">list</span>[<span class="built_in">int</span>]</span>) -&gt; <span class="built_in">int</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    intervals_len = <span class="built_in">len</span>(intervals)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> intervals <span class="keyword">is</span> <span class="literal">None</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">0</span></span><br><span class="line">    </span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(intervals_len):</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> intervals[i][<span class="number">0</span>] &gt; intervals[i][<span class="number">1</span>]:</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">raise</span> Exception(<span class="string">&quot;输入区间不合法&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">            </span><br><span class="line">    intervals.sort(key=<span class="keyword">lambda</span> x: x[<span class="number">1</span>])</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="built_in">len</span>(intervals)-<span class="number">2</span>):</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> intervals[i + <span class="number">1</span>][<span class="number">0</span>] &lt; intervals[i][<span class="number">1</span>]:</span><br><span class="line">            intervals.pop(i+<span class="number">1</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> intervals_len - <span class="built_in">len</span>(intervals)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h2 id="测试结果一览"><a href="#测试结果一览" class="headerlink" title="测试结果一览"></a>测试结果一览</h2><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>用例</th>
<th>输入</th>
<th>正确答案</th>
<th>我的代码结果</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>1</td>
<td><code>[[1,4],[2,3],[3,5],[4,6]]</code></td>
<td>2</td>
<td>2</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>2</td>
<td><code>[[1,5],[2,3],[3,4],[4,6],[5,7]]</code></td>
<td>2</td>
<td>2</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>3</td>
<td><code>[[1,3],[2,4],[3,5],[4,6],[5,7]]</code></td>
<td>2</td>
<td>❌ IndexError</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>4</td>
<td><code>[[1,3],[2,4],[3,5],[4,6],[5,7],[6,8],[7,9]]</code></td>
<td>3</td>
<td>❌ IndexError</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<h2 id="问题一览"><a href="#问题一览" class="headerlink" title="问题一览"></a>问题一览</h2><h3 id="1-边界问题"><a href="#1-边界问题" class="headerlink" title="1. 边界问题"></a>1. 边界问题</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">intervals_len = <span class="built_in">len</span>(intervals)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> intervals <span class="keyword">is</span> <span class="literal">None</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">0</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<p>输入 None 将会报错。</p>
<p><strong>解决办法</strong>：先判空再求长度。</p>
<p>应改为：</p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> intervals <span class="keyword">is</span> <span class="literal">None</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">0</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="built_in">len</span>(intervals)):</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> intervals[i][<span class="number">0</span>] &gt; intervals[i][<span class="number">1</span>]:</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">raise</span> Exception(<span class="string">&quot;输入区间不合法&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">intervals_len = <span class="built_in">len</span>(intervals)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="2-遍历中删除元素"><a href="#2-遍历中删除元素" class="headerlink" title="2. 遍历中删除元素"></a>2. 遍历中删除元素</h3><p>修改列表导致索引混乱，容易超索引。</p>
<p><strong>解决办法</strong>：只计数，不修改原列表。</p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="built_in">len</span>(intervals)-<span class="number">2</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> intervals[i + <span class="number">1</span>][<span class="number">0</span>] &lt; intervals[i][<span class="number">1</span>]:</span><br><span class="line">        intervals.pop(i+<span class="number">1</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<p>这段代码的思路是把不重叠的区间留下。</p>
<p><strong>模拟用例执行过程（用例3）</strong>：</p>
<p>输入：<code>[[1,3], [2,4], [3,5], [4,6], [5,7]]</code></p>
<p>原始长度 n &#x3D; 5，<code>range(5-2) = range(3)</code> → i &#x3D; 0, 1, 2</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>i</th>
<th>当前列表</th>
<th>比较 i+1 和 i</th>
<th>是否删除</th>
<th>删除后列表长度</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>0</td>
<td><code>[[1,3],[2,4],[3,5],[4,6],[5,7]]</code></td>
<td>2&lt;3 ✅</td>
<td>删 [2,4]</td>
<td>4</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>1</td>
<td><code>[[1,3],[3,5],[4,6],[5,7]]</code></td>
<td>4&lt;5 ✅</td>
<td>删 [4,6]</td>
<td>3</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>2</td>
<td><code>[[1,3],[3,5],[5,7]]</code></td>
<td>i&#x3D;2 时 i+1&#x3D;3</td>
<td>列表只有3个元素，索引3不存在</td>
<td>❌ 崩溃</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<p><strong>问题</strong>：当 i&#x3D;2 时，列表长度已经变成 3，最大索引是 2，但访问 <code>intervals[3]</code> → IndexError。</p>
<p><strong>漏查问题</strong>：删掉 i+1 后，原本的 i+2 变成了新的 i+1，但下次循环 i 增加了，这个新的 i+1 不会被检查。</p>
<h2 id="修改后的代码（未通过）"><a href="#修改后的代码（未通过）" class="headerlink" title="修改后的代码（未通过）"></a>修改后的代码（未通过）</h2><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">eraseOverlapIntervals</span>(<span class="params">intervals: <span class="built_in">list</span>[<span class="built_in">int</span>]</span>) -&gt; <span class="built_in">int</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> intervals <span class="keyword">is</span> <span class="literal">None</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">0</span></span><br><span class="line">    </span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="built_in">len</span>(intervals)):</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> intervals[i][<span class="number">0</span>] &gt; intervals[i][<span class="number">1</span>]:</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">raise</span> Exception(<span class="string">&quot;输入区间不合法&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">            </span><br><span class="line">    intervals.sort(key=<span class="keyword">lambda</span> x: x[<span class="number">1</span>])</span><br><span class="line">    count = <span class="number">0</span></span><br><span class="line">    end = intervals[<span class="number">0</span>][<span class="number">1</span>]</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="number">1</span>, <span class="built_in">len</span>(intervals)-<span class="number">1</span>):</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> intervals[i][<span class="number">0</span>] &lt; end:</span><br><span class="line">            count += <span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line">        end = intervals[i][<span class="number">1</span>]</span><br><span class="line">        </span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="built_in">len</span>(intervals) - count</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<p><strong>结果</strong>：示例并未通过。</p>
<h2 id="问题再览"><a href="#问题再览" class="headerlink" title="问题再览"></a>问题再览</h2><h3 id="1-索引问题"><a href="#1-索引问题" class="headerlink" title="1. 索引问题"></a>1. 索引问题</h3><p><code>range(1, len(intervals)-1)</code> 取不到 <code>len(intervals)-1</code>，所以漏测一个。</p>
<p><strong>改为</strong>：<code>range(1, len(intervals))</code></p>
<h3 id="2-条件错乱"><a href="#2-条件错乱" class="headerlink" title="2. 条件错乱"></a>2. 条件错乱</h3><p>判断条件是 <code>intervals[i][0] &lt; end</code>。</p>
<p>初始化 end 是第一个区间，后一个元素的区间开始小于前一个区间的结尾，说明区间重叠。count 此时代表去除的区间元素，而非保留元素，会导致返回结果时产生错误。</p>
<h3 id="3-何时改变-end"><a href="#3-何时改变-end" class="headerlink" title="3. 何时改变 end"></a>3. 何时改变 end</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="number">1</span>, <span class="built_in">len</span>(intervals)-<span class="number">1</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> intervals[i][<span class="number">0</span>] &lt; end:</span><br><span class="line">        count += <span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line">    end = intervals[i][<span class="number">1</span>]</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<p>end 更新在条件之外，代表每次遍历都更改 end，即列表里的区间都遍历了一遍，每个 end 只和前一个 end 比较。该错误操作导致 end 更新为了一个将要被移除的区间。实际上当区间不重叠时（即不满足条件时），才需要更新 end。</p>
<h2 id="最终正确解法"><a href="#最终正确解法" class="headerlink" title="最终正确解法"></a>最终正确解法</h2><h3 id="标准答案（计数移除区间数）"><a href="#标准答案（计数移除区间数）" class="headerlink" title="标准答案（计数移除区间数）"></a>标准答案（计数移除区间数）</h3><p>贪心解法：让未重叠的区间结束值最小，使后面与前面不重叠的概率最大，此为局部最优以达到全局最优。</p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">eraseOverlapIntervals</span>(<span class="params">intervals: <span class="built_in">list</span>[<span class="built_in">list</span>[<span class="built_in">int</span>]]</span>) -&gt; <span class="built_in">int</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> intervals <span class="keyword">is</span> <span class="literal">None</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">0</span></span><br><span class="line">    </span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="built_in">len</span>(intervals)):</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> intervals[i][<span class="number">0</span>] &gt; intervals[i][<span class="number">1</span>]:</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">raise</span> Exception(<span class="string">&quot;输入区间不合法&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">            </span><br><span class="line">    intervals.sort(key=<span class="keyword">lambda</span> x: x[<span class="number">1</span>])</span><br><span class="line">    count = <span class="number">0</span>  <span class="comment"># 初始化移除0个区间</span></span><br><span class="line">    end = intervals[<span class="number">0</span>][<span class="number">1</span>]</span><br><span class="line">    </span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="number">1</span>, <span class="built_in">len</span>(intervals)):</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> end &gt; intervals[i][<span class="number">0</span>]:  <span class="comment"># 前区间结束 &gt; 后区间开始，区间重叠</span></span><br><span class="line">            count += <span class="number">1</span>  <span class="comment"># 重叠区间应被移除，不改变end</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">else</span>:</span><br><span class="line">            end = intervals[i][<span class="number">1</span>]  <span class="comment"># 区间未重叠，更新end</span></span><br><span class="line">            </span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> count</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="我的绕弯子解法（计数保留区间数）"><a href="#我的绕弯子解法（计数保留区间数）" class="headerlink" title="我的绕弯子解法（计数保留区间数）"></a>我的绕弯子解法（计数保留区间数）</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">eraseOverlapIntervals</span>(<span class="params">intervals: <span class="built_in">list</span>[<span class="built_in">list</span>[<span class="built_in">int</span>]]</span>) -&gt; <span class="built_in">int</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> intervals <span class="keyword">is</span> <span class="literal">None</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">0</span></span><br><span class="line">    </span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="built_in">len</span>(intervals)):</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> intervals[i][<span class="number">0</span>] &gt; intervals[i][<span class="number">1</span>]:</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">raise</span> Exception(<span class="string">&quot;输入区间不合法&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">            </span><br><span class="line">    intervals.sort(key=<span class="keyword">lambda</span> x: x[<span class="number">1</span>])</span><br><span class="line">    count = <span class="number">1</span>  <span class="comment"># 保留区间数默认为1</span></span><br><span class="line">    end = intervals[<span class="number">0</span>][<span class="number">1</span>]</span><br><span class="line">    </span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="number">1</span>, <span class="built_in">len</span>(intervals)):</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> intervals[i][<span class="number">0</span>] &gt;= end:  <span class="comment"># 后开始值大于等于前结束值，区间未重叠</span></span><br><span class="line">            count += <span class="number">1</span>  <span class="comment"># 满足条件就保留</span></span><br><span class="line">            end = intervals[i][<span class="number">1</span>]  <span class="comment"># 区间未重叠，更新end</span></span><br><span class="line">            </span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="built_in">len</span>(intervals) - count  <span class="comment"># 计算移除的区间</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
